<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 76,048.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 76,048.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of November 7 totaled 76,048 bales, down from 76,704 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 36 bales issued, 725 decertification orders, 692 cancellations, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
